[{"title":"次韵山庄杂咏十首 其八 生香","author":"周密","text":"勾萌日条达，生意腔子满。\n一气自流行，色香有先晚。\n刻楮信徒劳，剪綵初无本。\n天机造群物，四序长衮衮。\n散我胸中春，八荒无间断。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35727,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵山庄杂咏十首 其九 流憩","author":"周密","text":"目视足不随，高山徒仰止。\n何能强筋力，进锐退亦锐。\n万里未为远，一息亦当至。\n徐行则不倦，寘足平稳地。\n策策更勉旃，闲云随步起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35728,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵山庄杂咏十首 其十 怀新","author":"周密","text":"我不如老农，绸缪先牖户。\n万宝忽已新，见此离离黍。\n田家终岁劳，一饱天所许。\n细诵七月诗，仁意森莫禦。\n年登而民贫，未谂何以故。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35729,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋登楼","author":"周密","text":"酌酒对孤月，今宵中半秋。\n古今嗟逝水，天地入高楼。\n宿鸟摇花影，轻云趁水流。\n何当太湖上，散发棹扁舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35730,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行用辘轳韵","author":"周密","text":"青山迎马首，翠霭湿征衣。\n前路柳俱绿，行人柳外归。\n残阳千里暮，闰岁百花迟。\n不是贪程客，时时认酒旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35731,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"周密","text":"体安一榻虚，昼梦有伦序。\n微风薰而清，泠然破轻暑。\n南窗数十竹，一一翠相语。\n檐玉声琤然，疾徐合商吕。\n鸣禽不避人，飞蝶自得侣。\n悠哉会吾心，一笑忘尔汝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35732,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"周密","text":"连日春寒不上楼，画屏斜掩梦悠悠。\n梅花吹尽成香雪，帘外东风未肯休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35733,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暑夜","author":"周密","text":"薄薄疏云漏月明，础根收润晚风清。\n空庭泥湿鸣蝼蝈，夜气如秋梦不成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35734,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荒冢","author":"周密","text":"荒冢漫漫长野蒿，老狐啼雨树萧萧。\n子孙已尽山移主，空剩残碑补断桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35735,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还自奉口","author":"周密","text":"倚柁西风顺，舟行势若趋。\n山平初月蚤，市远晚烟孤。\n客况三秋叶，乡心两岸芦。\n归期何日稳，趁得菊花无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35736,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野望怀思","author":"周密","text":"微风起微波，燕燕飞差池。\n雨馀野色靓，万绿皆纷披。\n汀洲多芳兰，采采今其时。\n所思在远道，日暮将谁遗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35737,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"买航归霅","author":"周密","text":"身世飘浮叹逝波，登瀛超海事蹉跎。\n风灯飐浪摇乡梦，夜橹鸣霜杂棹歌。\n元子一官真漫耳，曾参三釜奈贫何。\n归来好觅玄真子，浮玉山前理钓蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35738,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽李太监二首 其一","author":"周密","text":"人间五福最难全，寿考康宁八十年。\n贺监酒船空鉴曲，赞皇吟屋冷平泉。\n庭前玉树呈三秀，架上香芸续□□。\n生死哀荣无一恨，御风归作玉楼仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35739,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽李太监二首 其二","author":"周密","text":"抠衣犹欠日熙堂，仅拜仪刑振鹭行。\n洛社旧人无狄监，贞元朝士失刘郎。\n新丘已隔三秋月，老圃空惊一夜霜。\n肠断素车三百两，箫笳不数汉南阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35740,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"周密","text":"嫩柳拖春眼眼愁，怨春人立柳边楼。\n芳心已被流莺说，手撚花枝暗点头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35741,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦觉","author":"周密","text":"梦觉花阴过数砖，一庭轻雨湿湘帘。\n碧桃蜚尽鹂黄老，万树青阴属杜鹃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35742,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏夜水亭","author":"周密","text":"月满方湖夜气凉，曲栏吟罢自徜徉。\n飞萤照水惊鱼跃，露滴荷心动细香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35743,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送谢景晖之澧阳","author":"周密","text":"扬舲从此别，千里水程宽。\n旧梦池生草，新吟澧有兰。\n楚乡春酒薄，湘浦雨灯寒。\n定有吟骚作，因风寄一看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35744,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访全独翁吟居","author":"周密","text":"蘋花溪上屋，牢落似深村。\n坏壁穿秋涨，空窗沁雨痕。\n静通诗境界，醉到古乾坤。\n除却吟友外，何人扣竹门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35745,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山房春晚","author":"周密","text":"蘋花吹香柳花落，秭归清啼答姑恶。\n午帘睡思逐晴丝，静听新篁堕春箨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35746,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒边次韵","author":"周密","text":"叶间双颗绽红肥，渐次春光到紫薇。\n可是楝花风讯恶，堤边怪得画船稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35747,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚郊行即事","author":"周密","text":"篱豆垂花陇麦齐，炊红篘绿小春时。\n田家处处丰年乐，画出豳风七月诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35748,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云山万里图","author":"周密","text":"山无重数水无边，浩浩春风万里天。\n老矣少文空有志，披图闲续卧游编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35749,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋愚隐园次陈伯芳韵","author":"周密","text":"故王临赏地，幽榭带横塘。\n乔木传家远，高荷过槛长。\n琴书千古意，花竹四时香。\n永日无尘事，心清境亦凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35750,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越日伯芳又有长句又次之","author":"周密","text":"万绿深藏碧玉壶，清游闲日意舒徐。\n小山桂发吟招隐，杜曲花浓赋遂初。\n门隔软红人逐鹿，湖分新渌我知鱼。\n飞花落叶成幽趣，底事清风为扫除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35751,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入宿太仓次黄汝济韵","author":"周密","text":"纸帐梅花梦，空斋夜气侵。\n壮怀中岁感，游子五更心。\n月转花阴直，春随柳色深。\n无人知此意，攲枕自微吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35752,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋养拙园桐丘","author":"周密","text":"诛茅得奇赏，结石成岑崟。\n曲折行青蛇，只尺藏幽深。\n兰风与桂露，芬郁云崖阴。\n湖山不待招，秀色窥青林。\n怡颜一舒啸，万象供登临。\n永歌逍遥游，静悦吾伊吟。\n荣枯验草木，飞跃观鱼禽。\n老桐被天风，吹作太古音。\n何劳出庭户，一笑会我心。\n居然悟天籁，毋事弦吾琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35753,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦游紫霞寤而感怆","author":"周密","text":"紫霞当日按凉州，曾到仙家十二楼。\n秋影满堂花外烛，冷香飞句柳边舟。\n冰弦泛月传新谱，芳槛移春接俊游。\n授简梁园人老去，年年葵麦长新愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35754,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄谢就道","author":"周密","text":"当年游事记西湖，岁月飘零旧雨疏。\n剡曲暮云频入梦，长安落叶正愁予。\n春前有客徵梅赋，霜后无人寄橘书。\n回首青云故人远，滞留惟有老相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35755,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瞰碧雨后即事","author":"周密","text":"清漪闲照影，凉意满阑干。\n湖近秋声早，廊虚月影宽。\n鹤栖庭翠湿，鱼动水香寒。\n欲放云来去，移将竹数竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35756,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次李监见寄韵二首 其一","author":"周密","text":"一曲长谣酒一樽，平生幽事在田园。\n孤云野鹤闲情远，流水青山古意存。\n爱竹每思眠白屋，种瓜已分老青门。\n短衣掩骭长竿钓，最忆南溪与北村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35757,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次李监见寄韵二首 其二","author":"周密","text":"竹色松声入梦凉，屐痕犹记印山廊。\n娟娟秋水芙蓉屋，采采芳洲薜荔裳。\n招隐几时寻旧约，怀人此日各他方。\n溟鲲林鴳知谁乐，欲把南华问老庄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35758,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"积庆山访金荪壁","author":"周密","text":"松香竹粉午阴清，闲玩幽芳静听莺。\n谁在白云堆里住，忽闻山半读书声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35759,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次牟德范客中即事","author":"周密","text":"华胥槐国梦中名，钟鼎山林孰重轻。\n争似东皋新雨足，短秧微月听蛙声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35760,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽雪林李和父二首 其一","author":"周密","text":"灯雨蘋洲忆旧盟，游仙赋就五云深。\n梁园授简春风醉，吴苑敲诗夜雪吟。\n贫病一生无旧业，江湖八十有知音。\n只鸡斗酒梅边屋，九辩空招不可寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35761,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽雪林李和父二首 其二","author":"周密","text":"生际斯文极盛时，乾淳诸老尽心知。\n四朝菏泽遗民传，千首吴兴处士诗。\n颇怪渊明生自些，绝怜和靖老无儿。\n死生遇合真难偶，奇事人传贞曜碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35762,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠李若虚","author":"周密","text":"江湖游遍到长安，自写名山作画看。\n蝉腹祇便风露饱，鹤心偏喜水云宽。\n袖中六甲三关式，肘后千金九鍊丹。\n更约小窗松月夜，素琴重为作猗兰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35763,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀施仲山","author":"周密","text":"春来日日两堤边，醒即狂吟醉即眠。\n午饮每赊新路酒，晚归多唤里湖船。\n生逢坡老怜词客，死共花翁配水仙。\n一点梅魂招不得，愁来时展咏香编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35764,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其一","author":"周密","text":"清映临澄渊，孤啸跻绝岭。\n片云开太虚，约略见秋影。\n铦飙刮浮翳，洗此玉万顷。\n飞冰点空青，淅洒发深省。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35765,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其二","author":"周密","text":"千山脱木瘦，四壁号虫瘖。\n每于动静间，窥见天地心。\n水落泽国秋，荐稻登川禽。\n一醉吾事毕，毋作呜呜吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35766,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其三","author":"周密","text":"露泫草并白，霜肃山弄黄。\n蜩螀底须哀，寒燠乃其常。\n蒲莲弄凉影，兰茝发野芳。\n独立天壤间，万籁供吟吭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35767,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其四","author":"周密","text":"语大类迂诞，语小徒咿优。\n据梧默不发，此心与天游。\n年运不假人，迅逝如川流。\n所叹道不昌，贫贱非所羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35768,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其五","author":"周密","text":"冲风挟新寒，激射窗纸破。\n寸心集百忧，惊叹中夕坐。\n岂无激昂志，蹇步多跌蹉。\n平治付圣贤，白云政堪卧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35769,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其六","author":"周密","text":"翳翳萤影微，札札虫羽振。\n一雁从西来，坐觉秋事进。\n漫游亦何有，所得雪满鬓。\n老我一卷书，风灯剔凉烬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35770,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其七","author":"周密","text":"矮屋病秋暍，内热烧中肠。\n濯濯雨露姿，心眼生奇凉。\n乡来翕翕威，奄忽归何方。\n天时且如此，人事安可常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35771,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其八","author":"周密","text":"有有必有无，无无乃无迹。\n憧憧一世中，草草百年客。\n何能强解事，穿凿辨坚白。\n醉卧蓬荜秋，落叶深一尺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35772,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其九","author":"周密","text":"万壑开青瑶，一雨凉意足。\n空明发遐想，八极归一瞩。\n意行不知远，路转云几曲。\n悠哉复悠哉，孤吟伫秋绿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35773,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感秋杂兴十解 其十","author":"周密","text":"激激泉底石，谡谡松下风。\n天籁生泬寥，地籁号崆峒。\n清响来无时，吹万有不同。\n忽得千古心，元自一噫中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35774,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访简上人退居不遇","author":"周密","text":"一庵秋影外，水竹自逶迤。\n爱静多辞客，因禅忽悟诗。\n藓香侵坐具，花净入军持。\n杖锡何方去，云边有鹤知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35775,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"残暑","author":"周密","text":"残暑有归意，倦游犹异乡。\n不知何处雨，顿觉夜来凉。\n老树摇黄落，秋花弄白香。\n登楼正多感，一笛起山阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35776,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙岳从军后归吴","author":"周密","text":"秋入金疮祇自悲，十年弓剑老西陲。\n不须更赋从军乐，且和田园杂兴诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35777,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"愁望","author":"周密","text":"竹枝袅袅采香舟，桃叶依依罨画楼。\n一种垂杨芳草色，江南江北尽供愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35778,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归航夜雨有感","author":"周密","text":"扣舷何处起吴歌，客思由来入夜多。\n感愤诗篇偏跌宕，飘浮身世任蹉跎。\n风摇岸火如飞电，雨打溪蓬似滴荷。\n十载别鸥成底事，依然西塞晒渔蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35779,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"飞来峰","author":"周密","text":"九里松香古寺边，岭云深处涌青莲。\n何年佛始入中国，此日山移自五天。\n僧定白猿吟夜月，客游苍鹫舞秋烟。\n幽人最怕山归去，自宿空亭听冷泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35780,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观潮","author":"周密","text":"一线微茫远未分，鼓行渐出海山门。\n六鳌玉界移天柱，万骑冰河渡夜军。\n天上亏盈随月魄，人间忠愤感胥魂。\n吴儿不怕蛟龙怒，踏浪翻旗入阵云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35781,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"问梅北山","author":"周密","text":"风行万里道，冰落千仞渊。\n草木凘欲尽，寂寂无华妍。\n彼美含章姿，炯炯方孤鶱。\n始知春风心，元在天地先。\n六阴忽已复，生意森无边。\n因之得道妙，花与诗俱玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35782,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题雪溪图四言","author":"周密","text":"宇宙无声，天地一色。\n扁舟何人，去来无迹。\n言虽不传，意自有得。\n千古真清，万里虚白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35783,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"周密","text":"九曲栏干六曲屏，翠窗罗薄护寒轻。\n空堂燕子归期误，分付梨花管月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35784,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感次韵","author":"周密","text":"底用人前诵子虚，子安知我不知鱼。\n最思万竹香中隐，剩采春薇读好书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35785,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江南怨","author":"周密","text":"徐庾风流恨未销，东风肠断冶城桥。\n临春结绮空千尺，不及王家燕子巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35786,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋砧怨","author":"周密","text":"风泠泠，月明明，风月谁家砧杵声。\n声声思远道，少妇朱颜老。\n不但捣衣愁，愁在无衣捣。\n不捣月下砧，欲捣游子心。\n游子心非铁，闻之宁不折。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35787,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访客南山僧舍","author":"周密","text":"入门都是竹，景象自然幽。\n爱此千竿碧，因成竟日留。\n月移山欲近，云起塔如浮。\n烟水秋城暮，疏钟送去舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35788,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白莲","author":"周密","text":"移根来太华，楚楚翠绡裳。\n玉冷擎仙掌，珠明滴露房。\n秋涵云影淡，水印月痕香。\n好结庐山社，轻尘避夜凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35789,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"目眚","author":"周密","text":"多缘因暑毒，或谓是肝虚。\n徼福黄连剂，羞明暗室居。\n医云宜戒酒，儿劝莫看书。\n颇远纷华事，观心得自如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35790,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试秋衣有感","author":"周密","text":"鬓霜吹不去，三见雁南飞。\n落叶已如此，倦游犹未归。\n愁生慈母线，尘化主家衣。\n耕钓真良策，初心不可违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35791,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"神山行题澄江仙刻","author":"周密","text":"空光不流八纮净，巀嶭神鳌开海镜。\n蓬莱八万四千门，琲琲珠房照仙影。\n琪花扑天天地香，天吴清海海不扬。\n鸟飞不度水沉羽，隔花安得窥渔郎。\n白霓仙人按仙曲，七十二鬟吟冷玉。\n鹅箫小品未成声，几度秋蜗换蛮触。\n帘花宫叶春不同，江妃一一金芙蓉。\n刘郎骨朽梦不到，五云空廓吟饥龙。\n灵霞漾红春苒苒，犀彩玉光摇宝燄。\n元君正坐郁萧台，笑指神州烟九点。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35792,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"愚隐适兴","author":"周密","text":"锦云照空明，苍烟贮闲静。\n中有曲曲廊，幽眇入诗境。\n小山悬秋香，澄渊度云影。\n流觞有古意，坐久苔石冷。\n展我架上书，万卷牙签整。\n抚我膝上琴，坐觉白日永。\n升高得孤峤，汲古有甘井。\n居然谢嚣?，宛若处幽屏。\n岂惟寄游息，端可事修省。\n何当佳月夕，来此步清景。\n此趣非言传，真乐当自领。\n野语质不华，聊以寓微警。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35793,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言二首 其一","author":"周密","text":"笑杀楦中青紫，从他皮里阳秋。\n白首潜郎不调，青云妄尉皆侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35794,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言二首 其二","author":"周密","text":"蕉鹿梦疑非梦，木雁材与不材。\n与其封一万户，何如饮三百杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35795,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]